			<div class="content" id="post-content-3857699">
									

<p>Here it is. This is probably the most ambitious skip I've written. I don't even want the 4000 slot; I just really want the 4800 slot<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-894632-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-894632-1')">1</a></sup>. There's also HTML here, so if you have NoScript or something on it might not show up.</p>
<p>A lot of people need to be thanked for this:</p>
