<p>So, I'm assuming that SCP-001 Scranton was warning Timeline E-2a0e8a129b before the collapse, but obviously the 001 Scranton universe Foundation is dumb as fuck so of course the message is encrypted. The Timeline E-2a0e8a129b Foundation does not decode this in time, as Newmans is seen attempting to communicate to other Sites, only to find out no one is there to respond. He realises all hope is lost, but transfers to information to the DEEPWELL, and classifies the info as LEVEL 5 in order to warn other universes.</p>
